# Force source files to always be treated as text, so a stray control byte
# (e.g. a raw NUL in a string literal) can never make a source file render as
# "Binary files differ" and thus slip through code review unseen. See the
# trust-envelope.ts incident fixed in the same series as this file's addition.
#
# `text` normalizes line endings to LF; `diff` overrides git's NUL-byte binary
# heuristic so these paths always produce a textual diff.
*.ts    text diff
*.tsx   text diff
*.js    text diff
*.mjs   text diff
*.cjs   text diff
*.jsx   text diff
*.rs    text diff
*.py    text diff
*.sh    text diff
*.json  text diff
*.jsonc text diff
*.toml  text diff
*.yaml  text diff
*.yml   text diff
*.css   text diff
*.scss  text diff
*.html  text diff
*.md    text diff
*.sql   text diff
